    <string name="ob_p4_body">Wotsɔa mɔzɔzɔ ƒe nɔnɔmetata, ʋukuku nyuie ƒe dzesi, dzoxɔxɔ ƒe nɔnɔmetata kple gɔmesesewo dzraa mɔzɔzɔwo ɖo.</string>
    <string name="ob_p5_title">Wowɔe na alesi nèʋunae</string>
    <string name="ob_p5_body">Azɔlizɔzɔ, gasɔdodo, do gasɔ alo ʋukuku. Tia wò ʋu eye nàdze mɔzɔzɔa gɔme kple pɔmpi ɖeka.</string>
